  "rationale": "MATCH is limited to the explicit named projection in algorithmSpec and compatibilitySpec. The pinned modern source unambiguously starts at natal Mệnh, starts nominal ages at Cục 2..6, advances according to sex equality with birth-year BRANCH yin/yang, assigns inclusive ten-year ranges, and produces exactly twelve periods. Supplying trusted server natal inputs instead of deriving the upstream astrolabe is an explicit compatibility boundary. Integer 1..125 validation and no placement outside the per-chart range are a strict adapter contract; these are not claims that upstream validates identical inputs or omits childhood fallback.",
